UILD file. If I `touch` the `./BUILD` I always get the nonempty glob afterwards. But after some combination of building, cleaning, and touching files, I'll get the empty glob again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/323124240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"chaoren","id":10055601,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU1NjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10055601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren","html_url":"https://github.com/chaoren","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/323126073","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3553#issuecomment-323126073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3553","id":323126073,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMyMzEyNjA3Mw==","user":{"login":"chaoren","id":10055601,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU1NjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10055601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren","html_url":"https://github.com/chaoren","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chaoren/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-08-17T16:33:04Z","updated_at":"2017-08-17T16:33:04Z","body":"Okay, I can reliably reproduce this now:\r\n```\r\n$ touch ./BUILD\r\n$ bazel query :all --output=build\r\n# /path/to/BUILD:6:1\r\nfilegroup(\r\n  name = \"glob\",\r\n  srcs = [\"//:nested/foo.txt\"],\r\n)\r\n\r\n# /path/to/BUILD:1:1\r\nfilegroup(\r\n  name = \"foo\",\r\n  srcs = [\"//:nested/foo.txt\"],\r\n)\r\n\r\n$ bazel clean\r\nINFO: Starting clean (this may take a while). Consider using --async if the clean takes more than several minutes.\r\n$ bazel query :all --output=build\r\n# /path/to/BUILD:6:1\r\nfilegroup(\r\n  name = \"glob\",\r\n  srcs = [],\r\n)\r\n\r\n# /path/to/BUILD:1:1\r\nfilegroup(\r\n  name = \"foo\",\r\n  srcs = [\"//:nested/foo.txt\"],\r\n)\r\n\r\n$ touch ./BUILD\r\n$ bazel query :all --output=build\r\n# /path/to/BUILD:6:1\r\nfilegroup(\r\n  name = \"glob\",\r\n  srcs = [\"//:nested/foo.txt\"],\r\n)\r\n\r\n# /path/to/BUILD:1:1\r\nfilegroup(\r\n  name = \"foo\",\r\n  srcs = [\"//:nested/foo.txt\"],\r\n)\r\n```\r\nIt seems `./nested/BUILD` is required for this to happen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/323126073/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commente